        "circle_size.descr": "<xdoc><p>Specifies the size of output circles in standard deviations.</p><ul><li><span title=\"1_STANDARD_DEVIATION\">1 standard deviation</span>—The output circles will be 1 standard deviation. This is the default.</li><li><span title=\"2_STANDARD_DEVIATIONS\">2 standard deviations</span>—The output circles will be 2 standard deviations.</li><li><span title=\"3_STANDARD_DEVIATIONS\">3 standard deviations</span>—The output circles will be 3 standard deviations.</li></ul></xdoc>",
